# A click on a stock in the Stock Monitor opens the game's Invest dialog for it (with the chart,
# 7D/30D tabs and the stats the Monitor's own detail view used to show); the Monitor keeps its list,
# sort and filters as they were. Uses Oil, which every city has. UI only; the player's monitor
# settings are put back.
name Stock Monitor: a click on a stock opens its Invest dialog; the list stays as it was
monitor remember
monitor close
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorButton
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-Oil
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderInfo
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOrderInfoStatKey-0-0 Yesterday
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOrderInfoStatKey-0-1 30-day high
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOrderInfoStatKey-2-1 Open orders
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulOrderInfo
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
capture monitor-click-opens-dialog
cleanup:
close-dialog
monitor close
monitor restore
